  "thag1.3:0.4": "1. 1. 3. ",
  "thag1.3:1.1": "paññaṃ imaṃ passa tathāgatānaṃ ",
  "thag1.3:1.2": "aggi yathā pajjalito nisīthe ",
  "thag1.3:1.3": "ālokadā cakkhudadā bhavanti ",
  "thag1.3:1.4": "ye āgatānaṃ vinayanti kaṅkhaṃ’ti. ",
  "thag1.3:1.5": "itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kaṅkhārevato thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. kaṅkhārevatattheragāthā. "
}
